        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Norton 1601 Series Door Closer</B>\r\n<p>\r\nSpecially designed for Utility and Storefront use. ADA compliant, Barrier Free for doors that need to meet ADA accessibility guidelines. Specially designed for Utility and Storefront door use. They have clean, distinct lines that blend well with aluminum doors and frames found on storefront doors, yet they make an attractive installation on wood or metal doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNorton 1601BF closers are non-handed and easy to install. <b>Tri-Packed</b> - Can be installed Regular Arm, Top Jamb, or Parallel Arm on either right or left hand doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable Sweep Speed: An independent regulation valve, hex-key operated, permits adjustment of the general closing speed. Adjustable Latch Speed: An independent regulating valve, hex-key operated, permits adjustment of the door's speed for approximately the last 10-degrees of the closing cycle. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Also available: <a href=\"/products/norton-1600bc-series-door-closer\"><b>Norton 1600BC Fixed Spring Size Closers (size 3 or 4)</b></a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features: </b> for Norton 1601BF Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>All Weather Fluid</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 48\" interior / 48\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>All standard arm applications allow doors to\r\nswing 180°, conditions permitting</li>\r\n<li>Rack and Pinion Design (12 mm Square pinion shaft)</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.4</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 Certified</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n<li>UL10C Compliant for Positive Pressure</li>\r\n<li>30 Year Limited Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><b>ADA Compliant</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b>Tri-Packed</b></li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable 1 - 6</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1600.pdf?v=1704262192\" target=\"new\"><b>Norton 1601 Information Sheets (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
